+===================================================================
+=== SECTION 3: KEYBOARD SHORTCUT MAPPINGS & DESIGN              ===
+===================================================================
+
+Suggested Key Quota (Browser Limit: 4 max with suggested_key):
+  1. _execute_action: Default = Ctrl+Shift+A, Mac = Command+Shift+A (Open AlgoRecall Dashboard)
+  2. check-due-reviews: Default = Alt+Shift+R, Mac = Alt+Shift+R (Check Due Reviews Now)
+  3. view-due-cards: Default = Alt+Shift+D, Mac = Alt+Shift+D (View Patterns Due Today)
+  4. open-study-plan: Default = Alt+Shift+S, Mac = Alt+Shift+S (Open Exam Mode / Study Plan)
+
+Registered User-Configurable Commands (Registered in manifest without suggested_key):
+  5. toggle-theme: Description = Toggle Dark/Light theme
+  6. open-analytics: Description = Open Analytics Dashboard
+  7. open-pomodoro: Description = Open Pomodoro Timer
+  8. view-all-cards: Description = Open all saved patterns
+  9. view-retention-cards: Description = Open lapsed and retention patterns
+  10. open-forecast: Description = Open Review Forecast
+  11. open-history: Description = Open Review History
+  12. open-heatmap: Description = Open Full Screen Contribution Heatmap
+  13. toggle-floating-marker: Description = Toggle Floating Highlighter Marker Menu
+  14. open-highlights-manager: Description = Open Highlights Manager
+  15. open-highlights-options: Description = Open Highlighter Color Options
+  16. toggle-notifications: Description = Toggle Review Reminder Notifications
+  17. open-summary: Description = Open Weekly & Monthly Digest Summary
+  18. toggle-algo-launcher: Description = Toggle Problem Tracker Launcher
+  19. open-websites-manager: Description = Open Active Websites Manager
+  20. open-fsrs-config: Description = Open FSRS Algorithm Configuration
+  21. export-backup: Description = Export data backup
+  22. export-anki: Description = Export cards to Anki
+  23. open-help: Description = Open AlgoRecall Help & Guide
+  24. rate-extension: Description = Rate AlgoRecall on Web Store
+
+Conflict Analysis:
+  - Alt+Shift+R: Safe on Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari (avoids Ctrl+R page reload, Cmd+Shift+R hard reload).
+  - Alt+Shift+D: Safe on Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari (avoids Ctrl+D bookmark, Cmd+Shift+D bookmark all tabs).
+  - Alt+Shift+S: Safe on Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari (avoids Ctrl+S save page, Cmd+Shift+S system screenshot on Windows/Mac).
+  - Alt+Shift prefix is consistently reserved for extension shortcuts and avoids standard OS/browser window management keys.
+
+Native Shortcut Configuration Endpoints:
+  - Chrome: chrome://extensions/shortcuts
+  - Edge: edge://extensions/shortcuts
+  - Firefox: about:addons -> Manage Extension Shortcuts
+  - Safari: Safari Settings -> Extensions -> Shortcuts
